*.dxf binary
*.ply binary
*.las binary
*.laz binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.pt binary
*.pth binary
*.pkl binary
*.ckpt binary
*.onnx binary
*.engine binary
